# {{.Name}}

A Go web application built with the [HAMR framework](https://github.com/FyrmForge/hamr).

## Prerequisites

- Go {{.GoVersion}}+
- Docker (for PostgreSQL)
- [templ](https://templ.guide) CLI (`go install github.com/a-h/templ/cmd/templ@latest`)
- [hamr](https://github.com/FyrmForge/hamr) CLI

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dev tools (templ)
make install

# Start local services{{- if not .MigrateAtStartup}} and apply the schema{{- end}}
make docker-up
{{- if not .MigrateAtStartup}}
make migrate
{{- end}}

# Run the dev server (builds, live reload)
hamr dev
```

The server starts at [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) (proxied from :8080).

## Development

```bash
hamr dev            # Run dev server (live reload)
make build          # Build binary to bin/site
make test           # Run tests
make lint           # Run golangci-lint
make templint       # Lint .templ files
{{- if not .MigrateAtStartup}}
make migrate        # Run all pending migrations
{{- if eq .DBConnector "sqlx"}}
make migrate-down   # Roll back the last migration
make migrate-status # Show current migration version
make migrate-create NAME=xxx  # Create a new migration
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
make db-sh          # Open pgcli shell to local dev DB
make docker-up      # Start services
make docker-down    # Stop services
```
{{- if .MigrateAtStartup}}

> **Note:** Migrations run automatically when the server starts.
{{- end}}
{{- if .IncludeE2E}}

## E2E Testing

```bash
make e2e            # Run containerized E2E tests
make e2e-local      # Run against local server
make e2e-run T=Test # Run specific test
```
{{- end}}

## Project Structure

```
cmd/site/              Application entry point
{{- if not .MigrateAtStartup}}
cmd/migrate/             {{- if eq .DBConnector "sqlx"}} Standalone migration runner{{- else}} GORM auto-migration runner{{- end}}
{{- end}}
internal/
  config/                Environment configuration
  db/                    Database{{- if eq .DBConnector "sqlx"}} + migrations{{- else}} + models{{- end}}
  repo/                  Data access layer
  web/                   HTTP handlers + components
static/                  CSS, JS, images
docker/                  Docker Compose
docs/                    Documentation
```

## Stack

- **Go** {{.GoVersion}} + Echo v4
- **Templ** + HTMX{{if .IncludeAlpine}} + Alpine.js{{end}}
- **PostgreSQL**{{- if eq .DBConnector "gorm"}} + GORM{{- end}}
- **HAMR Framework** — server, middleware, validation, responses
